diff --git a/PRIVACY.md b/PRIVACY.md
index 32e7197..39e61db 100644
--- a/PRIVACY.md
+++ b/PRIVACY.md
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+# OTTPlay Native privacy
+
+This derived build has all third-party telemetry endpoints hard-disabled at compile time. No environment variable or setting enables analytics or crash uploads. Native Plex requests go directly to the selected server, and optional QR login talks to Plex. Imported profile credentials are never included in the application package.
+
+The inherited privacy design below documents the upstream mechanisms; reporting features described there are unavailable in this distribution.
+
 # PlxNative Privacy Policy
 
 Applies to PlxNative 0.6.0. Last updated 4 September 2026.
